<object id="scope" label="The parallel join defines eventual settlement of both obligations, not same-day or same-period cash payment. An obligation may remain open at a reporting cutoff.&#xa;AttendanceException records flag evidence; this model does not claim every flag blocks payroll. Independent time-to-register-to-GL reconciliation is a proposed teaching control." bpmnType="heading" ><mxCell style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#152b35;strokeColor=#196252;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#FFFFFF;whiteSpace=wrap;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=13;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="937" width="1800" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
